---
.title = "Submit Low-Level Io Operations in a Batch",
.date = "2026-09-29",
.author = "ZigCC",
.layout = "section.shtml",
---

`std.Io.Operation` is the lower-level interface beneath `Future` and `Select`.
`std.Io.Batch` submits several file, device, or network operations, reports
completions by index, and can cancel pending operations.

